  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Once news of the three kings inheritance cannot be hidden, Fang Yuan mass-purchases rank one exploding egg Gu in Shang clan city together with dog enslavement Gu and paper crane Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          323
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "loc_shang_clan_city",
          "gu_dog_enslavement_gu",
          "gu_paper_crane_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Old Zhang maps the three entry Gu to the three pillars: dog enslavement Gu for King Quan’s yellow pillar, paper crane Gu for King Xin’s blue pillar, and exploding egg Gu for King Bao’s red pillar.",
        "chapters": [
          324
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "king-bao-inheritance-key",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_king_quan",
          "char_king_xin",
          "char_king_bao"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "At first entry, small-world laws leave only the matching key usable; King Quan modified the blessed land so a Gu Master may bring in rank one dog enslavement Gu while other Gu cannot be used, and King Xin Inheritance and King Bao Inheritance follow the same pattern with paper crane Gu and rank one exploding egg Gu. After Fang Yuan refines the next-round dog enslavement Gu reward in King Quan Inheritance, heavenly power relocates him.",
        "chapters": [
          346
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "king-bao-inheritance-key",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master",
          "inh_king_xin_inheritance",
          "inh_king_bao_inheritance",
          "inh_king_quan_inheritance"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing enter King Bao Inheritance together, Fang Yuan can use only one exploding egg Gu. The inheritance’s aim in that round is to make him use exploding egg Gu to exterminate the red eggmen and advance. He lets the eggmen injure him instead, and judges that even using exploding egg Gu at that point could not change the situation.",
        "chapters": [
          376
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-rounds-inside-king-bao-inheritance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_bai_ning_bing"
        ]
      }
    ]
